#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <b>Inventory app</b> allows you to manage all of your stock operations, "
"including inputs, outputs, and internal movements. When you validate a "
"purchase or sales order, a corresponding receipt or delivery is "
"automatically created."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Inventaris</b> memfasilitasi pengelolaan semua operasi stok, "
"termasuk penerimaan, pengeluaran, dan pergerakan internal. Saat Anda "
"memvalidasi order pembelian atau order penjualan, tanda terima atau nota "
"pengiriman yang bersangkutan akan dibuat secara otomatis."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <b>PLM (Product Lifecycle Management) App</b> is your dedicated "
"environment for managing the evolution of your products. It allows you to "
"review and iterate on every Bill of Materials (BOM) update, ensuring that "
"all modifications are tracked and visible within a specialized application."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi PLM (Product Lifecycle Management)</b> adalah lingkungan khusus "
"untuk mengelola evolusi produk. Aplikasi ini memungkinkan peninjauan dan "
"iterasi setiap pembaruan Bill of Material (BOM), memastikan semua modifikasi "
"terlacak dan terlihat dalam aplikasi khusus."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <b>Project app</b> centralizes all the necessary information, ensuring a"
" smooth and perfectly managed follow-up process."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Project</b> memusatkan semua informasi yang diperlukan, "
"memastikan proses follow-up selalu lancar dan dikelola dengan sempurna."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <b>Shopfloor App</b> serves as a direct bridge between production and "
"quality management, allowing workers to maintain high standards and suggest "
"improvements in real time."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Shopfloor</b> berfungsi sebagai penghubung langsung antara "
"bagian produksi dan manajemen kualitas, yang memungkinkan pekerja "
"mempertahankan standar tinggi dan menyarankan perbaikan secara real time."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Replenishment view gives you a clear overview of all current and future needs (you can adjust the <b>Horizon settings</b> to see what's coming up). From this screen, you can directly create purchase orders, subcontracting orders, or\n"
"      manufacturing orders."
msgstr ""
"Tampilan Replenishment memberikan gambaran yang jelas mengenai semua "
"kebutuhan sekarang dan mendatang (sesuaikan <b>pengaturan Horizon</b> untuk "
"melihat akan datang). Dari layar ini, Anda dapat langsung membuat order "
"pembelian, order subkontrak, atau\n"
"       order produksi."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
