#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.contactus
msgid ""
"We collaborate with trusted, high-quality partners to bring you reliable and"
" top-notch products and services."
msgstr ""
"Kami berkolaborasi dengan partner yang tepercaya dan berkualitas tinggi "
"untuk menghadirkan produk dan layanan yang andal dan terbaik."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.contactus
msgid ""
"We deliver personalized solutions, ensuring that every customer receives "
"top-tier service tailored to their needs."
msgstr ""
"Kami menghadirkan solusi khusus untuk memastikan setiap pelanggan menerima "
"layanan terbaik yang disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan masing-masing."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.contactus
msgid ""
"We provide 24/7 support through various channels, including live chat, "
"email, and phone, to assist with any queries."
msgstr ""
"Kami menyediakan bantuan 24/7 melalui beragam channel, termasuk live chat, "
"email, dan telepon, untuk membantu menjawab pertanyaan apa pun."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.homepage
msgid ""
"We provide a 30-day satisfaction guarantee for all custom orders. Items must"
" be in their original condition, unused, and include the order confirmation."
" Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days after receiving the returned"
" item."
msgstr ""
"Kami memberikan jaminan kepuasan selama 30 hari untuk semua pesanan khusus. "
"Barang harus dalam kondisi asli, belum pernah digunakan, dan disertai dengan "
"konfirmasi pesanan. Pengembalian dana diproses dalam waktu 5-7 hari kerja "
"setelah barang yang dikembalikan diterima."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.homepage
msgid ""
"We’re dedicated to delivering timely and effective manufacturing solutions "
"to ensure your success."
msgstr ""
"Kami berkomitmen untuk memberikan solusi produksi yang tepat waktu dan "
"efektif agar kesuksesan Anda terjamin."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "When you're ready to manage a transfer:"
msgstr "Saat Anda siap untuk mengelola transfer:"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When you're ready, you have the flexibility to create an invoice for either "
"a full or a partial payment, such as a down payment. All invoices generated "
"are tracked and can be managed through the <b>Invoices app</b>."
msgstr ""
"Jika sudah siap, Anda memiliki fleksibilitas untuk membuat faktur baik untuk "
"pembayaran penuh maupun sebagian, seperti uang muka. Semua faktur yang "
"dibuat dapat dilacak dan dikelola melalui <b>aplikasi Faktur</b>."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"While you can manually move an operation with a simple drag and drop, keep "
"in mind this change is isolated to that specific work order and will not re-"
"plan the others."
msgstr ""
"Meskipun Anda dapat memindahkan suatu operasi secara manual dengan metode "
"seret dan lepas, perlu diingat bahwa perubahan ini hanya berlaku untuk "
"perintah kerja tersebut dan tidak akan memengaruhi perencanaan perintah "
"kerja lainnya."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.homepage
msgid ""
"With over 15 years of industry expertise, we deliver tailored solutions and "
"strategic insights for your conveyor manufacturing needs."
msgstr ""
"Dengan 15 tahun keahlian industri, kami menghadirkan solusi sesuai kebutuhan "
"dan wawasan strategis untuk produksi konveyor Anda."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "Within the <strong>Inventory App</strong>"
msgstr "Dalam <strong>Aplikasi Inventaris</strong>"

